516
00:51:59.658 --> 00:52:00.658
Get up.

517
00:52:02.411 --> 00:52:08.031
Sit down. Get up. Sit down.
Roll right. Roll left.

518
00:52:09.543 --> 00:52:11.875
Do it right. Keep going!

519
00:52:16.800 --> 00:52:19.792
