540
00:53:54.648 --> 00:53:55.854
Wanna die?

541
00:54:05.909 --> 00:54:06.909
Taste good?

542
00:54:08.412 --> 00:54:10.903
It's so delicious.

543
00:54:11.540 --> 00:54:13.340
You're very happy to see
me, aren't you?

544
00:54:13.751 --> 00:54:15.287
Be good to me...

545
00:54:15.753 --> 00:54:17.744
And you'll always
be with good luck.

546
00:54:31.185 --> 00:54:35.563
